1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,426
Crumbs stuck under your MacBook keys?

2
00:00:02,633 --> 00:00:05,107
Hold the MacBook at about a seventy-five
degree

3
00:00:05,117 --> 00:00:08,718
angle, and spray compressed air in short
bursts,

4
00:00:08,728 --> 00:00:09,935
left to right.

5
00:00:10,133 --> 00:00:13,127
This lifts crumbs and dust from under the
keys.

6
00:00:13,418 --> 00:00:16,831
Keep the can upright, so no liquid comes
out.

7
00:00:17,033 --> 00:00:19,783
The full seven-step guide is on the
channel.
